                        <div class="clear"></div>
                    </div>

                </header>

                <div class="sidearm-common-bio-full">
                    <span style="color:#000000;">Debbie Watson is in her 15th year as the athletic business coordinator at Blinn College.  Her duties include handling the budgets for all sports, transportation arrangements, and many other duties for the athletic department.<br>
 <br>
She and her husband, Donny, have lived in Brenham for more than 36 years. Debbie has three grown children, a son and daughter-in-law, Donny and Krystle Watson, II, daughter and sons-in-law, Jessica and Heath Lowery, and Heather Watson and Logan Hough. She has four grandchildren, KaSarah, Casey, Kooper, and BaLynn Lalee.  Debbie loves spending time with her family and crafting.</span>
                </div>
            </article>

